## 1. The Real-Time Shock: How It Works
The system-wide dictation widget handles everything instantly without lag: [1] 

   1. The Trigger: While your backend is active, press Ctrl + Shift + Space (or Cmd + Shift + Space if you are using a Mac layout). [2] 
   2. The Stream: A small, frameless floating widget appears. As you talk, your voice streams directly into your RX 6700 XT over a local WebSocket connection. [1] 
   3. The Magic: The WhisperX AI engine transcribes your words in real time. The moment you stop speaking, the widget automatically types the text directly into your active window (like your stream chat or overlay) and instantly disappears. [1, 2] 

